// VoxWeaveTTS standalone DESKTOP Client examples (.jsonc documentation only).
// These do NOT apply to Firefox / Browser-based Web Control. For a browser,
// enter the Server URL from VoxWeaveTTS.exe, e.g. http://192.168.1.165:8775/
// Set these values directly in VoxWeaveTTS-Client.exe.
// Actual Client preferences are saved to data/client-connection.json.
// The Password is NEVER written to this file and must be entered on connection.

// A) Server on the same PC (remote gateway must be enabled):
{"host":"127.0.0.1","port":8776,"username":"voxweave"}

// B) Server on another computer in the same trusted LAN:
{"host":"192.168.1.165","port":8776,"username":"voxweave"}

// C) Server configured to use a custom control port:
{"host":"192.168.1.165","port":9888,"username":"studio_pc"}

// Do not enter 0.0.0.0 as the Client host: it is only a server bind address.
// Do not enter the Core API port (8765) or the Live Audio port (8766).
// Do not save Password in this file. Use Client UI to enter it per session.
